@Alexander Yordanov That's not true. 
I bought the GTX 780 back in May 2013 for example, the R9 290 was nowhere to be seen and I wanted a high end GPU.

When the R9 290 later launched in November 2013 the performance between the cards was basically identical. The R9 290 is obviously the king today but when you buy high end cards, do you really care about the future? No, you care about the present. I left my GTX 780 long ago.
